Works AvatarForcing builds on (credited by its authors)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - FLOAT: "Generative Motion Latent Flow Matching for Audio-driven Talking Portrait",
    Taekyung Ki, Dongchan Min, Gyeongsu Chae, ICCV 2025 —
    https://github.com/deepbrainai-research/float. Its code is CC BY-NC 4.0; its README
    states the checkpoints are released under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 for research use.
    AvatarForcing's motion autoencoder (architecture and weights) derives from FLOAT's.
  - LIA: "Latent Image Animator: Learning to Animate Images via Latent Space
    Navigation", Yaohui Wang, Di Yang, Francois Bremond, Antitza Dantcheva, ICLR 2022 —
    https://github.com/wyhsirius/LIA (CC BY-NC 4.0). The motion autoencoder
    architecture (encoder / style decoder) originates here.
  - Self-Forcing and Diffusion Forcing (training / sampling ideas, no code included).

